 "blurb": "A real 3D cube or box, drawn anywhere in the frame, with the clip, a picture or a colour on each of its six faces. Turn it on all three axes past a whole turn, let it spin on its own, move it in depth, stretch it into a box, round its corners and draw its edges. Light it from any side with shine, give it a soft shadow and a reflection on a floor, and look at it through a wide or long lens, or flat with no perspective. Make a face see-through or empty to look inside it. Search words: 3D, cube, box, dice, spin, rotate, turn, block.",
